flowchart LR
	NORM["the normalize flavors - the tool-results overpass arm,<br/>prepend: true, the OUTERMOST listener"] --> CCRR["hook-dsh-ccr - the compression<br/>sees the NORMALIZED bytes"]
	CCRR --> COACH["hook-dsh-tool-coach - plain, after ccr:<br/>observe + count + tier-1 notes,<br/>never replaces content"]
	CCRR --> MARK["the CCR marker - pure ASCII, so it passes<br/>through the whole normalize family<br/>untouched under any load order"]
	MARK -. "the model re-reads it from its own<br/>transcript intact" .-> MODEL["the model's context"]
